# NAME: AppleIntelligence
# MAINTAINER: reallinzc
# REVIEWED: 2026-11-10
# SOURCE: https://support.apple.com/101555
# Siri, Private Cloud Compute, plus the Apple Intelligence region/eligibility
# set (location, asset catalog, iCloud setup, iTunes bag) chosen on 2026-11-10.
# Shared hosts (gspe1-ssl.ls.apple.com, icloud-content.com, mesu, itunes) are
# included on purpose; DOMAIN-KEYWORD,siri matches any host containing "siri".

# Siri
DOMAIN,guzzoni.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,smoot.apple.com
DOMAIN-KEYWORD,siri

# Private Cloud Compute relays
DOMAIN,apple-relay.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN,apple-relay.fastly-edge.com
DOMAIN,cp4.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN,apple-relay.apple.com

# Region / eligibility / model assets
DOMAIN,gs-loc-cn.apple.com
DOMAIN,gspe1-ssl.ls.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,smp-device-content.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,xp.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mesu.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN,bag.itunes.apple.com

# iCloud setup / gateway
DOMAIN,gateway.icloud.com
DOMAIN,p150-acsegateway.icloud.com
DOMAIN,setup.icloud.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,icloud-content.com
